### Page contents

| Section | Coverage |
|---------|----------|
| **Purpose** | Tab-order vs visual reading order; Playwright samples up to 48 stops; four violation kinds with thresholds (72px vertical, 96px horizontal, 40px same-row band, 16 suppressed chrome links) |
| **Passing signals** | Header → Kpn/landing-nav → main → footer flow; no positive tabindex; dropdown panels in DOM order |
| **Failing signals** | `positive-tabindex`, `reverse-vertical`, `reverse-horizontal`, `handbook-chrome-tab-suppressed` with evidence shapes |
| **Before example** | Failing: `flex-row-reverse` on `fs-primary-nav-global-inner` + `tabindex="3"` on hero CTA |
| **After example** | Passing: skip link, LTR Kpn, `fs-nav-dropdown` with `data-fs-nav-dropdown`, default tabindex, footer |
| **Evidence and remediation** | `navFocusOrderReport` fields + 6-step fix order + harness re-run commands |
| **Related rules** | `DET.LANDMARKS.REQUIRED`, `DET.NAV.DEPTH`, `DET.NAV.BREADCRUMB`, `DET.NAV.IN_PAGE_TOC`, `DET.APP.FOCUS_TRAP` |

